  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The REST api documentation is seriously lacking, and in places incorrect. While the REST api was in beta, this was acceptable, but I we want to stabilize the API for production use, we must do better documentation. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We should do a review of the REST code, in order to ensure that the documentation describes the various cases.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "We should ensure that output format is properly documented, and adhere to schemas or the like.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The current docs can be found here: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/REST+API"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/REST+API",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
